## How to Activate Real Data

1. Add your Datalab API key to [.env](file:///d:/BillBotAI/.env):
   ```
   CHANDRA_API_KEY=your_real_key_here
   ```
2. Start the backend:
   ```powershell
   venv\Scripts\python.exe -m uvicorn backend.main:app --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8000
   ```
3. Start the frontend:
   ```powershell
   cmd /c "npm run dev"
   ```
4. Upload a pharmacy invoice image (JPG/PNG) and click **START CHANDRA EXTRACTION** — the results panel will populate automatically when the pipeline finishes.
